# Cursor - Arc XP Contenidos

> Arc XP Fusion (React+Webpack) | Read `openspec/specs/*.md` on demand | See `/AGENTS.md` for details

## Critical Guardrails

**NEVER modify**: `.fusion/`, `components/output-types/` without approval
**Multi-site**: `default.jsx`=la-nacion-ar, `foodit.jsx`=foodit (keep separated)

## Specs (read on demand)
- `openspec/specs/fusion-components.md` - Architecture, consumer/presenter
- `openspec/specs/common-ui-libs.md` - @ln UI libs (check first!)
- `openspec/specs/styling.md`, `testing.md`, `git-commits.md`

## Commands (Cmd+K)
**OpenSpec**: `/opsx:new`, `/opsx:continue`, `/opsx:apply`, `/opsx:archive`
**Fusion**: `/fusion-component`, `/fusion-debug`, `/fusion-update-libs`
**Git**: `/git-commit`

## Rules Applied
- `arcxp-fusion-components.mdc` - Component patterns
- `arcxp-openspec-fusion-workflows.mdc` - Workflow guidance
- `git-workflows.mdc` - Git conventions

## Behavior
- Use @ln libs before creating new UI
- Follow consumer/presenter pattern
- Test: `npm run build-dev && npm test -- [specific]`
